                  "For the rest of the turn, give yourself extra movement equal to your [Speed](srd-5.2/08/rules-definitions/speed)."
                ],
                [
                  "[Disengage](srd-5.2/08/rules-definitions/disengage)",
                  "Your movement doesn't provoke [Opportunity Attack](srd-5.2/08/rules-definitions/opportunity-attacks) for the rest of the turn."
                ],
                [
                  "[Dodge](srd-5.2/08/rules-definitions/dodge)",
                  "Until the start of your next turn, attack rolls against you have [Disadvantage](srd-5.2/08/rules-definitions/disadvantage), and you make Dexterity saving throws with [Advantage](srd-5.2/08/rules-definitions/advantage). You lose this benefit if you have the [Incapacitated](srd-5.2/08/rules-definitions/incapacitated) condition or if your Speed is 0."
                ],
                [
                  "[Help](srd-5.2/08/rules-definitions/help)",
                  "Help another creature's ability check or attack roll, or administer first aid."
                ],
                [
                  "[Hide](srd-5.2/08/rules-definitions/hide)",
                  "Make a Dexterity ([Stealth](srd-5.2/01/proficiency/skill-proficiencies/skill-list/stealth)) check."
                ],
                [
                  "[Influence](srd-5.2/08/rules-definitions/influence)",
                  "Make a Charisma ([Deception](srd-5.2/01/proficiency/skill-proficiencies/skill-list/deception), [Intimidation](srd-5.2/01/proficiency/skill-proficiencies/skill-list/intimidation), [Performance](srd-5.2/01/proficiency/skill-proficiencies/skill-list/performance), or [Persuasion](srd-5.2/01/proficiency/skill-proficiencies/skill-list/persuasion)) or Wisdom ([Animal Handling](srd-5.2/01/proficiency/skill-proficiencies/skill-list/animal-handling)) check to alter a creature's attitude."
                ],
                [
                  "[Magic](srd-5.2/08/rules-definitions/magic)",
                  "Cast a spell, use a magic item, or use a magical feature."
                ],
                [
                  "[Ready](srd-5.2/08/rules-definitions/ready)",
                  "Prepare to take an action in response to a trigger you define."
                ],
                [
                  "[Search](srd-5.2/08/rules-definitions/search)",
                  "Make a Wisdom ([Insight](srd-5.2/01/proficiency/skill-proficiencies/skill-list/insight), [Medicine](srd-5.2/01/proficiency/skill-proficiencies/skill-list/medicine), [Perception](srd-5.2/01/proficiency/skill-proficiencies/skill-list/perception), or [Survival](srd-5.2/01/proficiency/skill-proficiencies/skill-list/survival)) check."
                ],
                [
                  "[Study](srd-5.2/08/rules-definitions/study)",
                  "Make an Intelligence ([Arcana](srd-5.2/01/proficiency/skill-proficiencies/skill-list/arcana), [History](srd-5.2/01/proficiency/skill-proficiencies/skill-list/history), [Investigation](srd-5.2/01/proficiency/skill-proficiencies/skill-list/investigation), [Nature](srd-5.2/01/proficiency/skill-proficiencies/skill-list/nature), or [Religion](srd-5.2/01/proficiency/skill-proficiencies/skill-list/religion)) check."
                ],
                [
                  "[Utilize](srd-5.2/08/rules-definitions/utilize)",
                  "Use a nonmagical object."
                ]
              ],
              "title": "Actions",
              "type": "table"
            }
          ],
